# `.ai_local/`

This folder is optional developer-local working memory for AI-assisted work in this repository.

Use it for:

- Personal notes and scratch investigations.
- Local, non-secret environment quirks.
- Throwaway prompts and temporary AI session summaries.

Rules:

- Never commit this folder.
- Never treat anything here as authoritative.
- Never record product decisions here; use `.ai/adr/`.
- If this project uses Squad, never record Squad team decisions here; use Squad-owned `.squad/` state.
- Never store secrets, credentials, tokens, connection strings, or private keys here.

It is safe to delete this folder at any time.
